      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "                                                 How to Play\nWelcome
    to the Wall Breaker! In this game, you control a player who moves forward automatically
    while shooting at walls. Your mission is to destroy walls strategically to power
    up your army while avoiding deadly red walls.\nControls\n\nShooting: Automatic\nMovement:
    Character moves forward automatically( Press 'A'to go left, 'D' to go right)\nArmy
    Control: Your army follows your lead\n\n                                     
    Walls\nRegular Walls: Can be destroyed for bonuses\nRed Walls: DANGER! Hitting
    these means game over\nSpecial Walls: Some walls contain power-ups\n\n                                    
    Bullet Damage Boost\nDestroy certain walls to increase your shooting power\nMore
    damage = faster wall destruction\n\n\n                                    Army
    Size Increase\nCollect power-ups to grow your army\nLarger army = more firepower\n\n\n                                  
    Tips for Success\nAlways watch out for red walls - they mean instant defeat!\nStrategically
    choose which walls to destroy\nCollect power-ups whenever possible to strengthen
    your forces\nThe larger your army grows, the more powerful you become\nKeep moving
    and shooting to maintain momentum\n\n                                       
    Objective\nSurvive as long as possible while building the largest and most powerful
    army you can. Break walls, collect power-ups, and avoid red walls to achieve
    the highest score!\n                                         Warning\nRemember:
    RED WALLS = GAME OVER! Always stay alert and ready to dodge them."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
